  "instructions": [
    "Add 2 tablespoons of melted butter to a cazuela over medium-high heat.",
    "Once hot, add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped parsley and cook for an additional 30 seconds.",
    "Add the beaten free-range eggs and cook until just set, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the shredded cheddar cheese, shio-cured salt, black pepper, and Fresno pepper flakes.",
    "Stir until the cheese is melted and the mixture is well combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to the preheated oven and bake at 375°F (190°C) for 15-20 minutes.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with chopped fresh thyme.",
    "Serve warm with a squeeze of lemon juice and a pinch of kosher salt."
  ],
